text @[Construction Worker]
text Well done. You helped me a great deal.
text ...I can't move my arms.
text It's because I was holding up the street light the entire time.
text And not only that, but even just standing on top of the ladder in an unstable position has all but whittled down my stamina.
text My thighs are all swollen, and even my calves are aching.
text It was all I could do to plunge to the ground and try to calm my breathing.
text I used to have confidence in my stamina, but right now I felt so horrible, keeping up appearances is the last thing on my mind.
