sound Q82.aac
text @[Construction Worker]
text No matter what job you perform, this amount of work isn't out of the ordinary.
text He'd probably been working far harder than me, yet he manages to say this with a cool expression on his face.
text And with that, I'm finally made to realize.
text How comfortably I'd truly been living up until now.
text I am so fatigued right now, all the petty anxieties that I'd been fretting over in my life just look absurd to me.
text So becoming part of society means throwing yourself into this kind of lifestyle?
text I had imagined it before... but this went even further than all of my imaginings.
text Not to mention the man standing before is a young man, not far from my own age.
text For a man like that to be able to easily exclaim "This amount of work isn't out of the ordinary" was also quite a shock to me.
